  "description": {
    "morphology": "Centro-parietal negativity between about 300 and 500 ms, peaking near 400 ms (measured here at Cz), typically slightly right-lateralised and posterior.",
    "meaning": "Indexes semantic processing and the ease of integrating an item into its context. Amplitude is larger for semantically incongruent, unexpected or unprimed items.",
    "task": "Sentence reading with semantic violations, semantic priming, and picture-word or word-word matching."
